+/* The Win32 calls the launcher polls input with, on SDL2 (Linux). Only
+ * src/mm3_launcher.cpp includes this; the launcher's window comes from
+ * src/mm3_launcher_sdl.cpp. Keys are reported as the Windows virtual keys
